values ('ap_physics_1', 3, '3.2', array['3.2', '3.4']::text[], 'convention', 'Sign of work: positive when done on the system', 'Work done on a system is positive when it transfers energy into the system and negative when it transfers energy out of the system.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Work can also be zero, for example when the force is perpendicular to the displacement or when there is no displacement of the point of application.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-1-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_1-u3-r2-003; ced=3.2.A.1: "Work is the amount of energy transferred into or out of a system by a force"; 3.2.A.2: "may be positive, negative, or zero"')
