values ('ap_physics_1', 3, '3.3', array['3.3', '3.4']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Potential energy of a system', 'A system composed of two or more objects has potential energy if the objects within that system only interact with each other through conservative forces. Potential energy is a scalar quantity associated with the position of objects within a system.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-1-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_1-u3-r3-002; ced=3.3.A.1: "has potential energy if the objects within that system only interact with each other through conservative forces"; 3.3.A.2: "scalar quantity associated with the position of objects within a ; product-owner-directed correction by the Claude session (David, 2026-10-10): the escalated row was corrected against its own CED evidence and re-checked by both independent checkers and the own-family veto')
