values ('ap_physics_1', 3, '3.4', array['3.4']::text[], 'convention', 'Conservation of energy and system choice', 'If the work done on the selected system is zero and there are no nonconservative interactions within it, mechanical energy is constant; if the work is nonzero, energy is transferred between the system and its environment, and the change in total energy equals the energy transferred in or out.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'State which system you chose, since the choice determines whether its energy changes.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-1-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_1-u3-r1-020; ced=3.4.C.2, 3.4.C.3, 3.4.B.4 "that change will be equivalent to the energy transferred into or out of the system"')
